<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in very heavy trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 53.29 to 6,471.76, a record. For the week, the Dow rose 123.73 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.41 to 394.66, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose 25 cents.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1,497 to 956.</p>
<p>Volume was 525,208,364, compared with with 468,701,510 Thursday. For the week, volume was 2,338,038,364.</p>
